1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her name and ancestry are speculative. Many unsourced Internet genealogies say the wife of [http://www.geni.com/people/Aquilinus/6000000008406755546 Aquilinus] was '''Fuscina''', daughter of [http://www.geni.com/pe
2 CONC ople/Saint-Hesychius-I-Bishop-of-Vienne/6000000000312820005 Saint Hesychius of Vienne] and his wife [http://www.geni.com/people/Audentia/6000000005747722273 Audentia]. However, the source of that information is not clear.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the reconstruction of Ford Mommaerts, the wife of Aquilinus is unknown. The children of Hesychius and Audentia were [http://www.geni.com/people/Saint-Alcimus-Ecdicius-Avitus/6000000000312764214 Alcimus Ecdicius Avitus
2 CONC ], Bishop of Vienne and [http://www.geni.com/people/Apollinaris-bishop-of-Valence/6000000026256505754 Apollinarius], Bishop of Valence.
2 CONT
